name: Literal scope edits preserve membership through bounded discovery and report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 context:build indexed 3 files | source-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned literal source
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | imported-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 Enter / c build inventory | empty-scopes
keys: c
require-live-snap: 35 DRAFT SCOPES | whole-inventory
expect: all: 3 jobs
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 First scope name | split-name
type: Spaced app
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/spaced-path.txt
resize: 160x48
live-snap: literal-field-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: literal-field-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: literal-field-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: literal-field-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: literal-field-40x12
ask: Does the field retain both edge spaces, with a visible caret and literal-path guidance across all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
type: Other source
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/other-paths.txt
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r2 | exact-split
expect: all: 6 jobs
expect: Boundary: " app "
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART split
keys: f
require-live-snap: 20 Files 1..1 of 1 | literal-member
expect: " app /lib.py"
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Enter menu | member-back
keys: Enter /
type: Exclude a file or directory
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Exclude a file or directory | exclude-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 File or directory path | exclusion-field
paste-file: @ART/spaced-path.txt
keys: Tab
type: Defer only the literal spaced directory.
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r3 | excluded-exact-directory
expect: all: 3 jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART excluded
keys: Down Down Down f
require-live-snap: 20 Files 1..1 of 1 | excluded-member
expect: " app /lib.py"
ask: Does exclusion affect only the literal spaced directory while ordinary app remains included, with the reduced workload visible before approval?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Enter menu | excluded-back
keys: Enter /
type: Include an excluded file or directory
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Include an excluded file or directory | include-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Exact recorded exclusion path | literal-restoration
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 r4 | restored-exact-directory
expect: all: 6 jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restored
keys: Enter /
type: Exclude a file or directory
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Exclude a file or directory | invalid-action
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/invalid-path.txt
keys: Tab
type: Invalid literal must not become a root exclusion.
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 Action stopped | invalid-literal-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
ask: Does the invalid literal stay in its failed form, with the saved scope revision and all source membership unchanged and no work started?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Enter menu | invalid-back
keys: Enter /
type: Use whole repository
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Use whole repository | whole-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 r5 | whole-repository-option
expect: all: 3 jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART whole
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 First scope name | split-again
type: Spaced app
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/spaced-path.txt
keys: Tab
type: Other source
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/other-paths.txt
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r6 | restored-finite-boundaries
expect: Boundary: " app "
resize: 160x48
live-snap: boundary-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: boundary-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: boundary-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: boundary-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: boundary-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: boundary-detail-40x12
ask: Are the quoted literal boundary, source limitations and finite workload readable across all six sizes, with the whole-repository choice still available?
resize: 120x36
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | acceptance
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-boundaries
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Space Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 2 boundaries marked | selected-boundaries
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | finite-study
expect: 6 fixed discovery jobs
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Scope draft ready | frozen-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | work-approval
expect: 6 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 1
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-approval
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-plan
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | completed-jobs
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-results
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-spaced.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 FINDING | spaced-finding
submit: decision deferred Spaced directory owner policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-plain.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 FINDING | plain-finding
submit: decision deferred Plain directory owner policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-root.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 FINDING | root-finding
submit: decision deferred Loose root owner policy review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | report
expect: 2 boundaries
expect: 0 committed / 1 calls
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | json-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 format vuln-findings (6/6) | external-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | external-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART external
ask: Do actual scans keep the two directory names and loose root file distinct, with separate recurrence, unchanged severity, explicit human deferrals and a completed-plan receipt in export?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | recovered-jobs
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/literal_scope_membership.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restart
ask: Does no-color restart retain the exact accepted boundaries, six completed jobs, nine observations and three decisions without another job or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
